RF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and April to May came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2025, July to August hit 69% of normal and November to December hit 61%. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 37% of normal on the middle of the grids. On grid 21174 the driest year was 1963 at 60%.</p>"}
